    "In the Photo Booth tab, switch the preview to Photo Booth, pick a format (Khmer Stamp, Strip, Grid, Polaroid, Film, Minimal, Story 9:16, Square 1:1, Sticker, Comic, Receipt, Ronaldo Legacy, BTS ARMY Scrapbook, Web Hero City Night), a background, a filter and a backdrop (Off, Blur, or a scene that matches the frame, to hide your room) while a live sample shows you in that style, then press Take photos. It takes 3 or 4 photos with a countdown, fills the picture in as you go, and saves it as a PNG in Pictures › Tisa Dynamic Island Photos. The shortcut opens the tab straight in Photo Booth mode. The Khmer Photo Booth window is still in the menu bar." : {
      "comment" : "A longer explanation of the Photo Booth mode feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
